  <Callout kind="remember">
    A press first picks which reels to free, from groups and protection, and
    only then lands them, by slam or by quicken. A slam cancels and poses; a
    quicken removes the waiting and keeps the landing. The first press that
    ends a round also speeds up the next one.
  </Callout>
